        "",
        "Return only this JSON object shape:",
        '{',
        '  "definition": {"status": "...", "text": "...", "supporting_evidence_labels": ["E1"], "abstention_reason": ""},',
        '  "scope": {"status": "...", "text": "...", "supporting_evidence_labels": ["E2"], "abstention_reason": ""}',
